                                        "entry_id": "bd5e0db9-6913-379b-a53a-eca5faf32367",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A region of Georgia, in the western part of the country, bordered by the eastern end of the Black Sea with Ozurgeti as its regional capital."
                                        ],
